			"notes": "# 1.4.0\n\n## NOTES\n- All current saved configurations will be reset. This is a necessary change.\n   - When upgrading from trident to island++, there was issues due to differing config values, now they have different physical locations.\n- API integration requires an API key that you can get from https://gateway.noxcrew.com/\n\nThis release adds:\n- API integration\n  - Island exchange listing prices displayed for tradable items in all contexts where possible\n    - Infinibag, Infinivault, My Profile, Island Exchange, etc.\n  - Uncaught fish rarity/weight combos highlighted in spot dialog\n- Meter dialog will no longer reset when opening the menu to unclaimed rewards\n  - Meter dialog should automatically reset at the reset time mentioned in the menu\n- Utilities dialog\n  - \"Announce Pylon\" will announce your current location to let everyone know that there is a pylon there. This will also announce time remaining.\n  - API Fetch buttons (New fish, Exchange data)\n- Repaired and paused hints for supplies dialog\n- Spot dialog has option to display as percent odds instead of expected counts\n- New Fish % chance added to spot dialog\n- And more! Bug fixes, additions, etc."
		},
